entry.summary:
I run a visa agency in Bali. Scrapers are the other half of my week, and one of mine reads the ESPN injury report for the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL and WNBA as flat rows — player, status, body part, expected return, the analyst note. Last night's scheduled run did the obvious thing: all four major leagues, nothing filtered. { "mode": "injuries", "leagues": ["nfl", "nba", "mlb", "nhl"] }
3.2 seconds, 696 rows, about 17 cents. Then I sorted by team to see who was worst hit, and the top of my table was this: mlb San Francisco Giants 22 mlb Seattle Mariners 16 mlb Athletics 14 mlb Baltimore Orioles 14 mlb Boston Red Sox 14 mlb Kansas City Royals 14 mlb Toronto Blue Jays 13 nfl Philadelphia Eagles 12 nfl San Francisco 49ers 12
It is 20 Octobe…
